CITY OF CHEYENNE
CONTRACT MODIFICATION

Contract Modification:
#1
Project:

Leachate System Maintenance
Project Number:

Contract # 7769
Contractor:

Terracon Consultants, Inc
Date Prepared:

May 2, 2024

The above referenced contract is amended or modified as set forth in the following and these
amendments and modifications of the plans and specifications are agreed to by the parties. All other
aspects of the original agreement remain unchanged and in full force and effect.

I. Description of Changes
The changes provide for a two-year extension of Contract #7769 for maintenance of the leachate
system at the Happy Jack Landfill. The Contract will be extended from June 15, 2024 through June
14, 2026. Terracon Consultants, Inc agrees to perform all maintenance work as detailed in the
original contract.

This modification will increase the amount of the contract by $99,800.

II. New Contract Items
All items to remain the same as original contract.

III. Schedule
Maintenance will be performed quarterly and semi-annually (confined space only). A 72-hour
on-call service is included for emergencies.

IV. Summary

Original Contract Amount ...................................................................................$61,400.00
Previous Modifications ......................................................................................................$0
Contract Amount Prior to this Modification ........................................................$61,400.00
This Modification ................................................................................................$99,800.00
New Contract Amount .......................................................................................$161,200.00

V. GL Account Information

